{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54480","headline":"兵要望江南 委任第一（京本作「占委任第一」二十六首） 二十六 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 委任第一（京本作「占委任第一」二十六首） 二十六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吾势鋭，人马总精雄。\n财宝（京本作「货」）满盈军用足（辛本、川本、京本作「足用」），更详天象审苍穹，灾祸免（辛本、川本、京本作「那」）军中。\n（经曰：「用兵者，非信义不立，非阴阳不顺，非奇正不列，非诡谲不战，谋藏於心，事见於迹，心与迹同者败，心与迹异者胜。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54480.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54480","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}